{"id":399,"flavor":[{"games":["Legends: Arceus"],"text":"Bidoof has an unsophisticated face and is rarely flustered by anything. There have been incidents involving Bidoof sauntering into villages and gnawing on the houses without a single care."},{"games":["Alpha Sapphire","Y","Pearl"],"text":"It constantly gnaws on logs and rocks to whittle down its front teeth. It nests alongside water."},{"games":["Omega Ruby","X","Diamond"],"text":"With nerves of steel, nothing can perturb it. It is more agile and active than it appears."},{"games":["White 2","Black 2","White","Black","Platinum"],"text":"A comparison revealed that Bidoof’s front teeth grow at the same rate as Rattata’s."},{"games":["SoulSilver","HeartGold"],"text":"It lives in groups by the water. It chews up boulders and trees around its nest with its incisors."}],"abilities":[{"name":"Simple","hidden":false,"description":"Doubles the effects of the Pokémon's stat changes."},{"name":"Unaware","hidden":false,"description":"When attacking, the Pokémon ignores the target's stat changes."},{"name":"Moody","hidden":true,"description":"Every turn, one of the Pokémon's stats will be boosted sharply but another stat will be lowered."}],"eggGroups":["Water 1","Field"],"genderRate":4,"hatchCounter":15,"baseHappiness":70,"growthRate":"medium","habitat":null,"color":"Brown","shape":"Quadruped","evolution":{"id":399,"name":"Bidoof","condition":null,"children":[{"id":400,"name":"Bibarel","condition":"Lv. 15","children":[]}]},"moves":{"game":"Ultra Sun / Ultra Moon","level":[[1,33],[1,45],[5,111],[9,205],[13,29],[17,158],[21,281],[25,242],[29,36],[33,162],[37,14],[41,133],[45,276],[49,174]],"machine":[213,59,451,590,104,497,263,218,447,237,58,182,240,156,216,496,247,214,164,241,207,14,269,168,87,86,85,92,526],"egg":[401,111,38,203,154,300,316,98,431,205,130,214,346],"tutor":[401,343,196,231,387,351,173,446,162,276]},"cards":[{"id":"swsh12pt5-111","name":"Bidoof","set":"Crown Zenith","date":"2023-01-20","rarity":"Common","num